      "dc:source": "telecommunications-amendment-act-1988.pdf, p.4",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Subject to subsections (2) and (3), this Act commences on the\nday on which it receives the Royal Assent.\n(2) Sections 5, 6, 10, 12 and 13 and subsections 23 (2) and 26 (1)\ncommence on a day to be fixed by Proclamation for the purposes of this\nsubsection.\n\nTelecommunications\nAmendment\nNo. 121, 1988\n(3) Section 14 and subsections 23 (3) and 26 (2) commence on a day to\nbe fixed by Proclamation for the purposes of this subsection.\nPART\nII—AMENDMENTS\nOF\nTHE\nTELECOMMUNICATIONS\nACT\nPrincipal Act",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Subject to subsections (2) and (3), this Act commences on the\nday on which it receives the Royal Assent.\n(2) Sections 5, 6, 10, 12 and 13 and subsections 23 (2) and 26 (1)\ncommence on a day to be fixed by Proclamation for the purposes of this\nsubsection.\n\nTelecommunications\nAmendment\nNo. 121, 1988\n(3) Section 14 and subsections 23 (3) and 26 (2) commence on a day to\nbe fixed by Proclamation for the purposes of this subsection.\nPART\nII—AMENDMENTS\nOF\nTHE\nTELECOMMUNICATIONS\nACT\nPrincipal Act",
      "cml:hasPart": [
