      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-amendment-act-1988-sec-8",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "8 Section 8",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-amendment-act-1988#sec-8"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-amendment-act-1988.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-amendment-act-1988.pdf, p.6",
      "values:originalText": "Section 10 of the Principal Act is amended:\n(a) by omitting from paragraph (1) (f) \"and\";\n(b) by omitting paragraph\n(1) (g) and substituting the\nfollowing\nparagraphs:\n\"(g) to form, and participate in the formation of, companies;\n(h) to subscribe for and purchase shares in, and debentures and\nother securities of, companies;\n(j) to enter into partnerships;\n(k)\nto participate in joint ventures and arrangements for the\nsharing of profits;\n(m) to enter into contracts (including futures contracts);\n(n) to deal with futures contracts;\n(o)\nto appoint agents and attorneys, and act as agent for other\npersons;\n(p)\nto accept gifts, grants, bequests and devises made to it, and\nact as trustee of money and other property vested in it by\ntrust;\n(q)\nto do such other things as it is authorised to do by or under\nthis Act or any other Act; and\n(r) to do anything incidental to any of its powers.\";\n(c) by adding at the end the following subsections:\n\"(5) Nothing in this Act authorises the Commission to form, or\nparticipate in the formation of, a company that would carry on the\nbusiness of providing:\n(a) a telecommunications system for Australia by the use of\nspace satellites; or\n(b) space satellite facilities for use in telecommunications systems\nfor neighbouring regions.\n\"(6) In subsection (5), 'Australia', 'neighbouring regions' and\n'space satellite' have the same respective meanings as they have in\nthe Satellite\nCommunications\nAct\n1984\".",
      "skos:definition": "Section 10 of the Principal Act is amended:\n(a) by omitting from paragraph (1) (f) \"and\";\n(b) by omitting paragraph\n(1) (g) and substituting the\nfollowing\nparagraphs:\n\"(g) to form, and participate in the formation of, companies;\n(h) to subscribe for and purchase shares in, and debentures and\nother securities of, companies;\n(j) to enter into partnerships;\n(k)\nto participate in joint ventures and arrangements for the\nsharing of profits;\n(m) to enter into contracts (including futures contracts);\n(n) to deal with futures contracts;\n(o)\nto appoint agents and attorneys, and act as agent for other\npersons;\n(p)\nto accept gifts, grants, bequests and devises made to it, and\nact as trustee of money and other property vested in it by\ntrust;\n(q)\nto do such other things as it is authorised to do by or under\nthis Act or any other Act; and\n(r) to do anything incidental to any of its powers.\";\n(c) by adding at the end the following subsections:\n\"(5) Nothing in this Act authorises the Commission to form, or\nparticipate in the formation of, a company that would carry on the\nbusiness of providing:\n(a) a telecommunications system for Australia by the use of\nspace satellites; or\n(b) space satellite facilities for use in telecommunications systems\nfor neighbouring regions.\n\"(6) In subsection (5), 'Australia', 'neighbouring regions' and\n'space satellite' have the same respective meanings as they have in\nthe Satellite\nCommunications\nAct\n1984\".",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-amendment-act-1988-sec-8-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-amendment-act-1988-sec-8-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-amendment-act-1988-sec-8-logic-deontic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3e1e4315d23477ec155801be683278d90c3a43ca896b97fcdc7946bd98734842",
      "skos:note": "Amends Section 10 of the Principal Act to expand its powers."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-amendment-act-1988#sec-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "8 Section 8",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 6,
      "values:originalText": "Section 10 of the Principal Act is amended:\n(a) by omitting from paragraph (1) (f) \"and\";\n(b) by omitting paragraph\n(1) (g) and substituting the\nfollowing\nparagraphs:\n\"(g) to form, and participate in the formation of, companies;\n(h) to subscribe for and purchase shares in, and debentures and\nother securities of, companies;\n(j) to enter into partnerships;\n(k)\nto participate in joint ventures and arrangements for the\nsharing of profits;\n(m) to enter into contracts (including futures contracts);\n(n) to deal with futures contracts;\n(o)\nto appoint agents and attorneys, and act as agent for other\npersons;\n(p)\nto accept gifts, grants, bequests and devises made to it, and\nact as trustee of money and other property vested in it by\ntrust;\n(q)\nto do such other things as it is authorised to do by or under\nthis Act or any other Act; and\n(r) to do anything incidental to any of its powers.\";\n(c) by adding at the end the following subsections:\n\"(5) Nothing in this Act authorises the Commission to form, or\nparticipate in the formation of, a company that would carry on the\nbusiness of providing:\n(a) a telecommunications system for Australia by the use of\nspace satellites; or\n(b) space satellite facilities for use in telecommunications systems\nfor neighbouring regions.\n\"(6) In subsection (5), 'Australia', 'neighbouring regions' and\n'space satellite' have the same respective meanings as they have in\nthe Satellite\nCommunications\nAct\n1984\"."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-amendment-act-1988-sec-8-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
