      "cof:pageNumber": 15,
      "values:originalText": "Section 72A of the Principal Act is amended:\n(a) by omitting subsection (1) and substituting the following subsection:\n\"(1) The Commission may:\n(a) borrow money from persons other than the Commonwealth;\nand\n(b) raise money otherwise than by borrowing.\";\n(b) by omitting subsections (4) and (5).\nFinancial policy of Commission"
