      "dc:source": "telecommunications-amendment-act-1988.pdf, p.16",
      "values:originalText": "Sections 79 and 79A of the Principal Act are repealed.\nAnnual report",
      "skos:definition": "Sections 79 and 79A of the Principal Act are repealed.\nAnnual report",
      "cml:asserts": [
