      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-amendment-act-1988.pdf, p.17",
      "values:originalText": "Section 7 of the Principal Act is amended by inserting after paragraph\n(2) (a) the following paragraph:\n\"(aa) the interception of a communication by another person lawfully\nengaged in duties relating to the installation or maintenance of\nPABX equipment;\".",
      "skos:definition": "Section 7 of the Principal Act is amended by inserting after paragraph\n(2) (a) the following paragraph:\n\"(aa) the interception of a communication by another person lawfully\nengaged in duties relating to the installation or maintenance of\nPABX equipment;\".",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-amendment-act-1988-sec-25-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-amendment-act-1988-sec-25-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7806472f90d82d27a63e9d5777d182bec9b1992f26e78f29465457ae176ac548",
      "skos:note": "Permission for interception by PABX equipment installers"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-amendment-act-1988#sec-25",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "25 Section 25",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 17,
      "values:originalText": "Section 7 of the Principal Act is amended by inserting after paragraph\n(2) (a) the following paragraph:\n\"(aa) the interception of a communication by another person lawfully\nengaged in duties relating to the installation or maintenance of\nPABX equipment;\"."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-amendment-act-1988-sec-25-norm",
