      "skos:definition": "force immediately before the commencement of section 12 of this Act have\neffect, after that commencement, as if they had been made under section 11\nof the Principal Act as amended by this Act.\n\nTelecommunications\nAmendment\nNo. 121, 1988\nDirections",
