      "dc:source": "telecommunications-amendment-act-1988.pdf, p.18",
      "values:originalText": "Act with respect to the performance of its functions and the exercise of its\npowers (being directions in force immediately before the commencement of\nsection 12 of this Act) have effect, after that commencement, as if they\nwere directions given to the Board under section 23 of the Principal Act as\namended by this Act in relation to the performance of the Corporation's\nfunctions and the exercise of the Corporation's powers.\nDelegations",
      "skos:definition": "Act with respect to the performance of its functions and the exercise of its\npowers (being directions in force immediately before the commencement of\nsection 12 of this Act) have effect, after that commencement, as if they\nwere directions given to the Board under section 23 of the Principal Act as\namended by this Act in relation to the performance of the Corporation's\nfunctions and the exercise of the Corporation's powers.\nDelegations",
      "cml:asserts": [
