      "cof:pageNumber": 18,
      "values:originalText": "(3) If section 12 of this Act commences before section 14 of this Act,\nsection 10B and paragraph 27 (1) (b) of the Principal Act as amended by\nthis Act have effect, after the commencement of section 12 of this Act and\nuntil the commencement of section 14 of this Act, as if a reference to an\nemployee were a reference to an officer or employee of the Corporation.\nExisting Managing Director"
