      "dc:source": "telecommunications-amendment-act-1988.pdf, p.18",
      "values:originalText": "(4) Subsections (2) and (3) cease to have effect if the person is appointed\nas Managing Director after the commencement of section 12 of this Act\n\nTelecommunications\nAmendment\nNo. 121, 1988\n(whether at the end of the present period of appointment of the person or\notherwise).\nExisting Chief General Manager",
