      "dc:source": "telecommunications-amendment-act-1988.pdf, p.19",
      "values:originalText": "14 of this Act, is an officer or employee of the Corporation continues to be\nemployed by the Corporation as if the person had been engaged by the\nCorporation under section 38 of the Principal Act as amended by this Act.\nHeading to Division 1 of Part V",
      "skos:definition": "14 of this Act, is an officer or employee of the Corporation continues to be\nemployed by the Corporation as if the person had been engaged by the\nCorporation under section 38 of the Principal Act as amended by this Act.\nHeading to Division 1 of Part V",
