      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-amendment-act-1988-sec-38-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "38(2) Section 38",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-amendment-act-1988#sec-38-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-amendment-act-1988.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-amendment-act-1988.pdf, p.20",
      "values:originalText": "(2) If section 14 of this Act commences before section 12 of this Act,\nthe Telecommunications\n(Interception)\nAct\n1979 has effect, after\nthe\ncommencement of section 14 of this Act and until the commencement of\nsection 12 of this Act, as if the definition of \"employee of the Corporation\"\nin subsection 5 (1) were omitted and the following definition were substituted:\n\" 'employee of the Commission' includes any person doing acts or things\non behalf of the Commission under arrangements made under section\n12 of the Postal Services Act\n1975\".\nTransfer of funds",
      "skos:definition": "(2) If section 14 of this Act commences before section 12 of this Act,\nthe Telecommunications\n(Interception)\nAct\n1979 has effect, after\nthe\ncommencement of section 14 of this Act and until the commencement of\nsection 12 of this Act, as if the definition of \"employee of the Corporation\"\nin subsection 5 (1) were omitted and the following definition were substituted:\n\" 'employee of the Commission' includes any person doing acts or things\non behalf of the Commission under arrangements made under section\n12 of the Postal Services Act\n1975\".\nTransfer of funds",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-amendment-act-1988-sec-38"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-amendment-act-1988-sec-38-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-amendment-act-1988-sec-38-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f02e904a44684bc0d09b6ec4eed5bbcb1cb3e46c6ca347426b143104e78766b6",
      "skos:note": "Conditional commencement of section 12 of this Act"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-amendment-act-1988#sec-38-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "38(2) Section 38",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 20,
      "values:originalText": "(2) If section 14 of this Act commences before section 12 of this Act,\nthe Telecommunications\n(Interception)\nAct\n1979 has effect, after\nthe\ncommencement of section 14 of this Act and until the commencement of\nsection 12 of this Act, as if the definition of \"employee of the Corporation\"\nin subsection 5 (1) were omitted and the following definition were substituted:\n\" 'employee of the Commission' includes any person doing acts or things\non behalf of the Commission under arrangements made under section\n12 of the Postal Services Act\n1975\".\nTransfer of funds"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-amendment-act-1988-sec-38-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
