      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-amendment-act-1988.pdf, p.21",
      "values:originalText": "The following provisions are amended by omitting\n\"Commission\"\n(wherever occurring) and substituting \"Corporation\":\nSections 3 (1) (definitions of \"authorized person\", \"telecommunications\nmessage\" and \"telecommunications system\"), 3 (2) (b) (iii) and (4),\n5, 5A, 6 (2) (b) (iv), (3), (4) and (5), 8, 9, 10 (1), (2), (4) and\n(5), 10A, 11 (7), 12 (5) and (6), 13, 14, 15, 16, 17, 18, 19 and 20,\n71 (3) and (4), 72, 72A (1), (2) and (8), 72B (1) and (2), 72c, 75,\n76 (1) and (2), 80, 81 (1) and (4), 83 (1), 84 (3) (b), 85, 87, 88,\n89 (2), 90, 92, 93, 94 (1), (2) (c), (3) and (4), 94A, 95, 96, 98 (2),\n(3) and (4), 99 (1C) and ( 1 D ) , 101, 103, 103A, 104, 105, 106, 107,\n108, 109, 110, 110A and 110B.",
      "skos:definition": "The following provisions are amended by omitting\n\"Commission\"\n(wherever occurring) and substituting \"Corporation\":\nSections 3 (1) (definitions of \"authorized person\", \"telecommunications\nmessage\" and \"telecommunications system\"), 3 (2) (b) (iii) and (4),\n5, 5A, 6 (2) (b) (iv), (3), (4) and (5), 8, 9, 10 (1), (2), (4) and\n(5), 10A, 11 (7), 12 (5) and (6), 13, 14, 15, 16, 17, 18, 19 and 20,\n71 (3) and (4), 72, 72A (1), (2) and (8), 72B (1) and (2), 72c, 75,\n76 (1) and (2), 80, 81 (1) and (4), 83 (1), 84 (3) (b), 85, 87, 88,\n89 (2), 90, 92, 93, 94 (1), (2) (c), (3) and (4), 94A, 95, 96, 98 (2),\n(3) and (4), 99 (1C) and ( 1 D ) , 101, 103, 103A, 104, 105, 106, 107,\n108, 109, 110, 110A and 110B.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-amendment-act-1988-sec-1-2-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0e745b0ae6250451efd23b89d71ccd5f54ea7650efebebb85f688675f560131c",
      "skos:note": "Amendments to various sections of the law"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-amendment-act-1988#sec-1-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "1 Section 1",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 21,
      "values:originalText": "The following provisions are amended by omitting\n\"Commission\"\n(wherever occurring) and substituting \"Corporation\":\nSections 3 (1) (definitions of \"authorized person\", \"telecommunications\nmessage\" and \"telecommunications system\"), 3 (2) (b) (iii) and (4),\n5, 5A, 6 (2) (b) (iv), (3), (4) and (5), 8, 9, 10 (1), (2), (4) and\n(5), 10A, 11 (7), 12 (5) and (6), 13, 14, 15, 16, 17, 18, 19 and 20,\n71 (3) and (4), 72, 72A (1), (2) and (8), 72B (1) and (2), 72c, 75,\n76 (1) and (2), 80, 81 (1) and (4), 83 (1), 84 (3) (b), 85, 87, 88,\n89 (2), 90, 92, 93, 94 (1), (2) (c), (3) and (4), 94A, 95, 96, 98 (2),\n(3) and (4), 99 (1C) and ( 1 D ) , 101, 103, 103A, 104, 105, 106, 107,\n108, 109, 110, 110A and 110B."
