      "values:originalText": "The following provisions are amended\nby omitting\n\"Commission\"\n(wherever occurring) and substituting \"Corporation\":\nSections 5 (1) (definitions of \"Managing Director\",\n\"subscriber\",\n\"telecommunications\nservice\",\n\"telecommunications\nsystem\"\nand\n\"telegram\"), 5 (2), 6 (2), 7 (2) and (3), 8 (1), 9 (2) (a) (ii), 11 (1), (2),\n(8) and (10) (a), 1 1 A (1), (2) (a) (ii) and (6), 15 (2A), 2 0 A , 2 0 B (1),\n\nTelecommunications\nAmendment\nNo. 121, 1988\n21 (6) and (8) (a), 30, 35 (2), 47, 48 (3) (d) (ii), 61 (1), 63 (a), 65A\nand 97.",
      "skos:definition": "The following provisions are amended\nby omitting\n\"Commission\"\n(wherever occurring) and substituting \"Corporation\":\nSections 5 (1) (definitions of \"Managing Director\",\n\"subscriber\",\n\"telecommunications\nservice\",\n\"telecommunications\nsystem\"\nand\n\"telegram\"), 5 (2), 6 (2), 7 (2) and (3), 8 (1), 9 (2) (a) (ii), 11 (1), (2),\n(8) and (10) (a), 1 1 A (1), (2) (a) (ii) and (6), 15 (2A), 2 0 A , 2 0 B (1),\n\nTelecommunications\nAmendment\nNo. 121, 1988\n21 (6) and (8) (a), 30, 35 (2), 47, 48 (3) (d) (ii), 61 (1), 63 (a), 65A\nand 97.",
